ial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">💫</span></span></span></p><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">전세계 기업용 소프트웨어 1위,</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">SAP가 직접 설계하고 양성하는</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">재무 애플리케이션 개발자 양성과정, SeSAC 금천캠퍼스 3기 수강생을 모집합니다.</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: in